      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2024-08-29T08:21:07.698Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you want to add a custom field to a core doctype without customizing the core doctype itself, you will need to create a custom app and then add the custom field using code. Check out the default HRMS app concept, which added a custom field to the core doctype or normal doctype, and see how it works: <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/how-to-edit-core-doctypes-like-doctype-or-user/127660/2\" class=\"inline-onebox\">How to edit core doctypes like DocType or User? - #2 by NCP</a></p>",
